; Setup's own texts in this language (SpliceAI-VariantScoring.iss, [Languages]).
[CustomMessages]
TaskShortcuts=Shortcuts:
TaskDesktopIcon=Create a &desktop shortcut
TaskGenomesGroup=Reference genomes:
TaskGenomes=&Copy the reference genomes to this PC (about 6 GB)
TaskRefdbGroup=Reference score databases:
TaskRefdb19=Reference score database hg&19 (about 1.1 GB)
TaskRefdb38=Reference score database hg&38 (about 1.1 GB)
RunNow=Start %1 now
CheckingRefdb=Checking the %1 reference score database on this PC...
RefdbKept=- %1: a valid database was already on this PC, so it was kept. It can be replaced with "From a folder (USB drive)..." in the program.
RefdbRenamed=- %1: the database already on this PC could not be used; it was renamed to %2 and the one from the drive copied.
RefdbNotRenamed=- %1: the database already on this PC could not be used and could not be renamed, so nothing was copied. Use "From a folder (USB drive)..." in the program.
NoSpaceTitle=Not enough free space for the reference data
NoSpaceText=Copying the reference genomes and databases needs about %1 GB, and this drive has %2 GB free.%n%nYou can install without copying them and pick the files from the drive in the program later (it keeps working only while the drive is plugged in), or free up space and run Setup again.
NoSpaceInstall=&Install without copying
NoSpaceBack=&Go back
DownloadTitle=Downloading SpliceAI
DownloadText=Setup is downloading SpliceAI %1 from pypi.org (about 16 MB).
DownloadFailedTitle=SpliceAI could not be downloaded
DownloadFailedText=Setup needs an internet connection once to download SpliceAI.%n%nDetails: %1%n%nCheck that this computer is connected to the internet and try again. If you continue without it, everything else is installed and the program will offer to download SpliceAI when it starts.
DownloadRetry=&Try again
DownloadSkip=&Continue without SpliceAI
UnpackFailed=SpliceAI was downloaded but could not be unpacked. The program will offer to install it when it starts.
RefdbNotesTitle=Reference score databases:
